WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.388
Let’s walk through Read the live exercise context.

00:00:03.388 --> 00:00:05.737
Use the tracker to place every record in the correct

00:00:05.737 --> 00:00:07.237
move and phase.

00:00:07.237 --> 00:00:10.175
Observer access is read-only, so treat the state as

00:00:10.175 --> 00:00:14.550
context for interpretation rather than permission to operate the exercise

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:14.713
.

00:00:14.713 --> 00:00:17.562
On this slide, white Cell controls the move,

00:00:17.562 --> 00:00:20.675
phase, countdown, and timer state shown to every

00:00:20.675 --> 00:00:21.613
role.

00:00:21.613 --> 00:00:24.762
In practice, use the tracker to place each artifact

00:00:24.762 --> 00:00:27.613
and update in the correct exercise window.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.747
Use the highlighted Live tracker area as your visual reference

00:00:31.747 --> 00:00:33.485
while you complete this check.
